#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-features.rst:7
#: 11df5fb1aeef44e485e866c2316d7b73
msgid ""
"Mission Planner Features are detailed in each of the following sections."
msgstr "Mission Planner 的各项功能在以下各节中详细说明。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-features.rst:9
#: c6de8b0e47d541d19a29479717cad276
msgid ""
"The sections are organized to match the major section of the Mission Planner"
" as selected in the menu along the top of the Mission Planner window."
msgstr "各节按照 Mission Planner 窗口顶部菜单栏中主要功能区的顺序进行组织。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-features.rst:13
#: 32893993020648a6a31b132406cc10d6
msgid ""
":ref:`CONNECT <common-connect-mission-planner-autopilot>` (Upper right "
"corner) - How to connect the Mission Planner to your ArduPilot. Selecting "
"communication devices and rates."
msgstr ""
":ref:`连接 <common-connect-mission-planner-autopilot>`（右上角）——如何将 Mission "
"Planner 连接到您的 ArduPilot，包括选择通信设备和通信速率。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-features.rst:16
#: 0d23a848280b4f8ca02f5843fcab6d7c
msgid ""
":ref:`DATA <mission-planner-ground-control-station>` - Information about "
"what you see, and things you can do in the Flight Data screens."
msgstr ""
":ref:`DATA <mission-planner-ground-control-station>` "
"——介绍飞行数据界面中各项内容的含义及可用操作。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-features.rst:19
#: 9cb52ce616914fcd9b2291bc46b72706
msgid ""
":ref:`PLAN <mission-planner-flight-plan>` - Information about the various "
"aspects of preparing flight plans (Missions), Fences, and Rally Points."
msgstr ":ref:`PLAN <mission-planner-flight-plan>` ——介绍飞行规划（任务）、围栏及集结点的规划方法。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-features.rst:21
#: 98af6ffc16ad48b2a8ca9b51f1a6c206
msgid ""
":ref:`SETUP <mission-planner-initial-setup>` - Information about what you "
"see and things you can do in the Setup screens. Especially the mandatory "
"setups required before operating."
msgstr ""
":ref:`SETUP <mission-planner-initial-setup>` "
"——介绍设置界面中的内容及可用操作，尤其是飞行前必须完成的强制设置项。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-features.rst:23
#: d3e2b6213bd24c88b21900ab81bb3623
msgid ""
":ref:`CONFIG <mission-planner-configuration-and-tuning>` - Information about"
" what you see and things you can do in the Configuration/Tuning screens."
msgstr ""
":ref:`CONFIG <mission-planner-configuration-and-tuning>` "
"——介绍配置/调参界面中的内容及可用操作。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-features.rst:26
#: 72549d8641594f15942ac56cd8a738ab
msgid ""
":ref:`SIMULATION <mission-planner-simulation>` - How you can use the Mission"
" Planner and a flight simulator to 'simulate' flying."
msgstr ""
":ref:`SIMULATION <mission-planner-simulation>` ——介绍如何使用 Mission Planner "
"配合飞行仿真器进行「模拟」飞行。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-features.rst:28
#: 8b2ae6b5f4fc4f16a7b355024b9c228e
msgid ""
":ref:`HELP <mission-planner-overview_support>` - About the help screen, and "
"how to get help with your questions about Mission Planner."
msgstr ""
":ref:`HELP <mission-planner-overview_support>` ——关于帮助界面的说明，以及如何获取 Mission "
"Planner 相关问题的帮助。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-features.rst:30
#: 2454f0ae447a477da8c544ad5ca4e329
msgid ""
":ref:`Advanced Mission Planner Features <other-mission-planner-features>` - "
"Mission Planner has a large number of additional functions and features. "
"This section documents many of them."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Mission Planner 高级功能 <other-mission-planner-features>` ——Mission "
"Planner 包含大量附加功能，本节对其中许多功能进行了说明。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-features.rst:32
#: af29f5371dcd4cb7ac526c174a5cd9a5
msgid ""
":ref:`Live Video <live-video>` - how to display live video on the Data "
"screen"
msgstr ":ref:`实时视频 <live-video>` ——如何在数据界面上显示实时视频"
